---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GlassButton from '../components/GlassButton.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Intuitive Tarot Consultations — Astrology with Anisha"
  description="Contemplative, psychological tarot readings by Anisha Banerji. Archetypal clarity, crossroad navigation, and empowered decision-making without fatalism or melodrama."
  currentPath="/tarot"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="pt-8 pb-10 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-14 md:pt-14 md:pb-16 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-20 bg-[#fcfbf9] dark:bg-[#090716] border-b border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl xl:max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <!-- Back to Home Link -->
      <div class="mb-4 sm:mb-6 text-left">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] hover:text-[#110f0d] dark:hover:text-[#ffffff] transition-colors font-medium select-none"
          aria-label="Back to homepage"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
          </svg>
          <span>Home</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] bg-white/90 dark:bg-purple-950/60 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/30 text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] mb-4 shadow-xs">
          <span>Contemplative Archetypes</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-tight leading-tight font-medium">
          Intuitive Tarot
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-[#2c2722] dark:text-[#f0ebe1] font-normal max-w-2xl xl:max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed italic">
          "The cards do not predict what is guaranteed; they illuminate the subconscious currents guiding your next conscious choice."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Narrative Section -->
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 lg:py-24 xl:py-28 bg-[#faf8f5] dark:bg-[#060410]">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] 2xl:max-w-[1560px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-10 xl:px-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">
        
        <div class="md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] leading-tight font-medium">
            A Psychological Mirror, Not Fortune-Telling
          </h2>
          <p>
            In my practice, the tarot is held as an exquisite archetypal library. Rooted in Jungian psychology and intuitive discernment, each of the 78 keys reflects a specific threshold of human development, grief, mastery, or transformation.
          </p>
          <p>
            When we lay the cards during a session, we are not trying to spy on a locked future. We are pausing the noise of everyday life to take an honest, compassionate inventory of what is happening beneath the surface of your conscious thoughts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 shadow-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#0c091f] aspect-[4/3] max-w-md md:max-w-none mx-auto">
            <img
              src="/images/studio.jpg"
              alt="Anisha's tarot consultation table"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Spread Formats -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl xl:max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium">
          Consultation Formats
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal mt-2">
          Tailored structures designed to resolve specific crossroads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 md:p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0f0b24]/90 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] font-semibold block mb-2">Crossroad Analysis</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium mb-3">The Two Paths</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal leading-relaxed">
              When facing a pivotal decision between two offers, partnerships, or creative trajectories, this spread explores the energetic consequences and inner alignment of each path.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20 text-xs text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] font-medium">
            Ideal for Career & Relocation Shifts
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 md:p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0f0b24]/90 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] font-semibold block mb-2">Relational Dynamic</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium mb-3">The Dyad Mirror</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal leading-relaxed">
              Unpacking the unspoken contracts, energetic projections, and genuine opportunities for growth within an intimate or business partnership.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20 text-xs text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] font-medium">
            Ideal for Partnerships & Healing
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 md:p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0f0b24]/90 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] font-semibold block mb-2">Seasonal Overview</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium mb-3">The Solar Return / Year Ahead</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal leading-relaxed">
              A comprehensive 12-month archetypal forecast mapping the dominant lessons, gifts, and fallow seasons for your upcoming year of life.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20 text-xs text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] font-medium">
            Ideal for Birthdays & New Years
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 text-center">
        <GlassButton
          text="Book a Consultation"
          href="/consultations"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
